msgstr "代码块"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:152
#: f15a27c061894896995a3aad64bd188d
msgid ""
"Use fenced code blocks with language. **Do not use unlabeled** `` ``` `` "
"**fences** for ASCII diagrams or directory trees — sphinx-intl turns "
"those into RST `::` and Chinese HTML leaks a bare `::`. Use a colon fence"
" instead:"
msgstr ""
"带语言标记的围栏代码块。**不要用无语言标记的** `` ``` `` **围栏**画 ASCII 图或目录树——sphinx-intl "
"会把它们变成 RST 的 `::`，中文 HTML 会漏出裸的 `::`。请改用 colon fence："

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:154
#: 3076e4188e4d4f16b2e1f6302a6ad532
msgid ""
"Controllers\n"
"        ↓\n"
"Hardware"
msgstr ""
