msgid "Vendored upstream README"
msgstr "Vendored upstream README"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:233
#: 04ff48b540d94e0eb4d9e88f093289ca
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`source/_vendored/` holds **pinned commit** copies of public upstream "
"Markdown so Sphinx can `{include}` a short slice. This site vendors "
"**README.md** files only: `ros2_robot_interface`, plus "
"`basic_joint_controller` and `adaptive_gripper_controller` from "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control). "
"[ros2_robot_interface API_REFERENCE.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/API_REFERENCE.md) stays a GitHub link "
"and is not copied into `_vendored/`."
msgstr ""
"`source/_vendored/` 存放公开上游 Markdown 的**钉选提交**副本，供 Sphinx `{include}` 一小段。本站只 vendoring **README.md**：`ros2_robot_interface`，以及 [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) 里的 `basic_joint_controller` 与 `adaptive_gripper_controller`。[ros2_robot_interface API_REFERENCE.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/API_REFERENCE.md) 保持 GitHub 链接，不复制进 `_vendored/`。"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:235
#: cff0c30d55b342889889fd4ae8a6d26c
msgid ""
"Pins: `source/_vendored/SOURCES.json` (`repo`, `path`, full commit `sha`,"
" `dest`)."
msgstr "钉选：`source/_vendored/SOURCES.json`（`repo`、`path`、完整提交 `sha`、`dest`）。"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:237
#: 594c22c1122e46a2961e3b6e3d792573
msgid ""
"# Re-fetch every pin in SOURCES.json\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --sync\n"
"make vendor-upstream\n"
"\n"
"# Verify header SHA / sha256 (CI; no network)\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --check\n"
"make vendor-check\n"
"\n"
"# Move one pin to latest main, or to a SHA\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump ros2_robot_interface\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump basic_joint_controller --sha"
" <full-sha>\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump adaptive_gripper_controller "
"--sha <full-sha>\n"
msgstr ""
"# Re-fetch every pin in SOURCES.json\npython3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --sync\nmake vendor-upstream\n\n# Verify header SHA / sha256 (CI; no network)\npython3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --check\nmake vendor-check\n\n# Move one pin to latest main, or to a SHA\npython3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump ros2_robot_interface\npython3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump basic_joint_controller --sha <full-sha>\npython3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump adaptive_gripper_controller --sha <full-sha>\n"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:252
#: ddaf20b70f0e40088b5368b16670ea78
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Commit `SOURCES.json` and the vendored markdown together. Relative / "
"private images are stripped on fetch so the HTML build does not depend on"
" missing files. After a bump, confirm the `{include}` `:start-after:` / "
"`:end-before:` strings on "
"[ros2_robot_interface](../4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md)"
" still match the README (omit `#` in those option values — Docutils "
"treats `#` as a comment)."
msgstr ""
"把 `SOURCES.json` 与 vendored markdown 一起提交。抓取时会去掉相对 / 私有图片，避免 HTML 构建依赖缺失文件。bump 之后，确认 [ros2_robot_interface](../4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md) 上 `{include}` 的 `:start-after:` / `:end-before:` 仍与 README 匹配（这些选项值里不要写 `#` —— Docutils 把 `#` 当注释）。"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:254
